# rice theme — "Deccan Gate" (दख्खन), the default.
# Silicon Valley × Sahyadri: Golden Gate orange, Bay fog, terminal green, on
# Deccan black. c1 = accent / hero   c2 = blue slot   c3 = cyan slot
# c4 = teal slot   base = the black every bar / panel / notification / terminal
# / lock / login screen sits on. Shades are derived by `rice-theme`.
name=deccan
c1=#f0522d
c2=#dfe5eb
c3=#39d98a
c4=#9fb4c7
base=#111215
